window.__GAME_I18N_UI__={"Free life simulation ·":"無料の人生シミュレーション ·","Real statistics from 172 countries":"172か国の実際の統計","Babies born since you opened this page":"このページを開いてから生まれた赤ちゃん","People who passed away in that time":"その間に亡くなった人","Lives kept in the memorial":"メモリアルに残された人生","See all":"すべて見る","If you were a baby born right now":"いま生まれる赤ちゃんだったら","See the statistics for all 172 countries":"172か国すべての統計を見る","Shared lives":"みんなの人生","The world you are born into":"あなたが生まれる世界","The past":"過去の世界","Today":"いまの世界","The future":"これからの世界","Any world":"どの世界でも","Year of birth":"生まれた年","How your country is drawn":"生まれる国の決め方","Babies born now":"いま生まれる赤ちゃん","The 8 billion alive now":"いま生きている80億人","Length of one life":"ひとつの人生の長さ","About 30 min":"約30分","About 1 hour":"約1時間","About 1.5 hours":"約1.5時間","Where you were actually born (optional)":"あなたが実際に生まれた国（任意）","Be born":"生まれる","♪ Calm music":"♪ 穏やかな音楽","Continue":"続きから","Memorials":"メモリアル","Visit the memorials":"メモリアルを見て回る","Meet a life at random":"ランダムに人生と出会う","My memorials":"わたしのメモリアル","Past lives":"前世の記録","Move my lives":"記録を移す","Show more past lives":"過去の人生をもっと見る","Tidy up the records":"記録を整理する","Delete all":"すべて消す","People in this simulation":"このシミュレーションの中の人たち","Where they live now":"いま暮らしている場所","Born in the same second":"同じ1秒に生まれた人たち","A pause":"ひと息","What comes from real data":"実際のデータにもとづくもの","Send feedback":"ご意見を送る","Update notes":"更新履歴","Add to Home Screen":"ホーム画面に追加","Privacy policy":"プライバシーポリシー","Terms and refunds":"利用規約と返金","Other questions":"そのほかの質問","Choosing your birthplace":"生まれる場所の選び方","Birth registration":"出生届","Name":"名前","Share birth card":"誕生カードを共有","Begin this life":"人生を始める","yrs":"年","Pause":"一時停止","Next decision":"次の決断","Next":"次へ","Auto mode":"おまかせ","♪ Music":"♪ 音楽","✎ Pauses":"✎ 思いを残す","◐ Light or dark":"◐ 画面の明るさ","Family and life":"家族と人生","Spend & invest":"お金を使う · 投資","Exit":"中断","Status":"状態","What do these mean?":"状態は何を表していますか？","Health":"健康","Happiness":"幸福","Knowledge":"知識","Relationships":"人間関係","Focus":"重点","Spend":"お金を使う","This year’s focus":"今年の重点","Change it anytime":"いつでも変えられます","Life record":"人生の記録","Newest first ·":"新しい順 ·","tap a line for ☆":"行を押すと☆","Show earlier lines":"以前の記録をもっと見る","At this same age":"いま、同じ年齢で","Life map":"人生地図","1 square = 1 year":"1マス = 1年","Survival curve":"生存曲線","Share of those born the same year still alive":"同じ年に生まれた人のうち、まだ生きている割合","A decision is waiting":"決断が待っています","Open it again":"もう一度開く","Back to top":"いちばん上へ","Live a whole life in today's world. Today's statistics hold to the end.":"いまの世界のまま、一生を生きます。いまの統計が最後まで続きます。","The first picks a country by its number of births each year, the second by its population. Either way, life starts at age 0.":"ひとつ目は毎年の出生数で、ふたつ目は人口で国を選びます。どちらでも、人生は0歳から始まります。","The time it takes to live to that country’s life expectancy. At 1 hour, a year passes in about 40–60 seconds. You can pause or speed up while you live.":"その国の平均寿命まで生きるのにかかる時間です。1時間なら、1年が約40〜60秒で過ぎます。生きている途中で一時停止や早送りもできます。","If you choose one, the life you live here is compared with the country you were really born in. It’s saved only on this device.":"選ぶと、ここで生きる人生を、あなたが実際に生まれた国と比べます。この端末にだけ保存されます。","You can leave the settings as they are and be born right away.":"設定はそのままで、すぐに生まれることもできます。","Heavy moments such as child death, child marriage, conflict and illness happen here as often as the real statistics say.":"子どもの死、児童婚、紛争、病気といった重い出来事も、実際の統計どおりに起こります。","Your lives are kept in this browser only.":"人生の記録は、このブラウザにだけ残ります。","A deleted life cannot be brought back. A life placed in a memorial stays in the memorial.":"消した人生は元に戻せません。メモリアルに置いた人生は、メモリアルに残ります。","Right now, about four babies are born every second. You become one of them and live that one life all the way to its end. Where you are born, and to whom, you don’t get to choose. Just as you didn’t.":"いま、1秒に約4人の赤ちゃんが生まれています。あなたはそのひとりになり、その人生を最後まで生きます。どこで、誰のもとに生まれるかは選べません。あなた自身がそうだったように。","People share the lives they lived here and what they felt. No names, no contact details. Only the lives remain.":"ここで生きた人生と、そのとき感じたことを、みんなが分かち合っています。名前も連絡先もありません。残るのは人生だけです。","Lives that someone lived to the end and wanted to keep. Anyone can stop by, light a candle and leave a word.":"誰かが最後まで生き、残したいと思った人生です。誰でも立ち寄って、ろうそくを灯し、ひとこと残せます。","For your 10 most recent lives, press 'See again' to reopen the death record and the share card.":"最近の10人分の人生は、「もう一度見る」を押すと死亡記録と共有カードをもう一度開けます。","In the same second you are born, other babies are born all over the world. Four of them live out their lives by the same statistics, shown alongside yours. No one chose where to be born.":"あなたが生まれたその1秒に、世界中でほかの赤ちゃんも生まれています。そのうち4人が同じ統計で人生を生き、あなたの人生と並べて表示されます。誰も、生まれる場所を選んではいません。","At 5, 15, 30, 50 and 70, time stops and asks you one question. Think about this person’s life and your own together, and leave a line if you like. At the end, you can say a few words to this person.":"5・15・30・50・70歳になると時間が止まり、ひとつ問いかけます。この人の人生とあなた自身の人生を重ねて考え、よければ一行残してください。最後には、この人にことばを贈れます。","For 172 countries: births, life expectancy by sex, infant and under-5 mortality, GDP per person (PPP), income inequality, years of schooling, university enrollment, employment in agriculture, fertility rate, maternal mortality, HIV, homicide rate, smoking rate, out-of-pocket health costs, child marriage rate and life satisfaction. The age at death comes from each country’s life tables by sex, and causes of death follow WHO and GBD patterns by region and age.":"172か国について、出生数、男女別の平均寿命、乳児・5歳未満の死亡率、1人あたりGDP（PPP）、所得格差、就学年数、大学進学率、農業就業率、出生率、妊産婦死亡率、HIV、殺人率、喫煙率、医療費の自己負担、児童婚の割合、生活満足度を使っています。亡くなる年齢は各国の男女別生命表から、死因は地域と年齢ごとのWHO・GBDのパターンにもとづいています。","If making decisions feels like too much, start a life and turn on 'Auto mode' in the bar at the top (the ⋯ menu on phones) to simply watch. You pick a focus for each year and make choices when decisions come up about school, work, love, moving abroad or medical care. Choices change a life, but it is hard to fully escape the statistics of the place you were born. Today’s world is calculated with today’s statistics, a past world with that year’s, and the coming world with UN and other projections. Income comes from the country’s income distribution (based on the Gini index), and amounts are shown in purchasing-power (PPP) dollars and in US terms, as they would feel at US prices. Suicide also happens from the teenage years on, as often as the real statistics say, without showing how or why.":"決断がたいへんに感じたら、人生を始めてから上のバー（スマートフォンでは⋯メニュー）で「おまかせ」をオンにすれば、ただ見守ることもできます。毎年の重点を選び、進学・仕事・恋愛・海外移住・医療などの決断が来たら選びます。選択は人生を変えますが、生まれた場所の統計から完全に抜け出すのは難しいものです。今の世界は今の統計で、過去の世界はその年の統計で、これからの世界は国連などの予測で計算します。収入はその国の所得分布（ジニ係数にもとづく）から決まり、金額は購買力平価（PPP）ドルと、米国の物価で感じる額で表示します。自殺も、10代以降に実際の統計どおりの頻度で起こりますが、方法や理由は表示しません。","Death, illness, war, poverty, drinking and gambling, drug dependence, violence at home, sexual violence and suicide happen here as often as the real statistics say, never shown in detail and always with where to find help, and a past world tells of real history such as wars and mass killings. It is made for ages 15 and up.":"死、病気、戦争、貧困、飲酒やギャンブル、薬物依存、家庭内の暴力、性暴力、自殺は、実際の統計どおりの頻度で起こります。詳しく描くことはなく、必ず相談先も示します。過去の世界では、戦争や大量虐殺といった実際の歴史も語られます。15歳以上を対象としています。","1 in 8 Billion is still in beta. If something seems off or you have an idea, let us know and we’ll keep fixing and improving it.":"80億分の1はまだベータ版です。おかしな点やアイデアがあれば教えてください。これからも直し、良くしていきます。","Ideas and feedback:":"アイデア・ご意見：","Affects the risk of dying and whether you can keep working. Exercise, checkups and looking after yourself raise it; age lowers it.":"死亡のリスクや、働き続けられるかに影響します。運動、健康診断、体をいたわることで上がり、年齢とともに下がります。","How satisfied you are with life. Income, family and friends, health and debt all affect it.":"人生にどれだけ満足しているか。収入、家族や友人、健康、借金がすべて影響します。","Affects entrance exams, job offers and your starting pay. Your family's means and your country's schools matter more, and above about 70 more of it makes little difference.":"入試や採用、初任給に影響します。家庭の経済力や国の学校のほうが大きく影響し、70を超えると上がってもあまり差は出ません。","Your bonds with family and friends. They affect marriage and its crises, talks with your children, the chance of being bullied at school, and loneliness in old age.":"家族や友人とのつながりです。結婚とその危機、子どもとの会話、学校でいじめられる可能性、老後の孤独に影響します。","Higher numbers raise the odds; they never decide the outcome. As in real life, luck and circumstances play their part too.":"数値が高いほど可能性は上がりますが、結果を決めるわけではありません。現実と同じように、運や環境も関わります。","Sources: UN World Population Prospects 2024, UN IGME, World Bank WDI, WHO (maternal mortality, smoking, health spending), UNESCO UIS, UNDP HDR, ILO, UNAIDS, UNODC, UNICEF, World Happiness Report 2024 (mostly via Our World in Data); past and coming worlds also use UN World Population Prospects 2024 and World Urbanization Prospects 2018, the Maddison Project 2020, UCDP/PRIO and Lee-Lee 2016. Some road death and child marriage rates, and missing values, were estimated from regional averages and similar methods. Data from the World Bank, Our World in Data, Maddison and UCDP (CC BY 4.0) and the UN (CC BY 3.0 IGO) were adapted.":"出典：UN World Population Prospects 2024、UN IGME、World Bank WDI、WHO（妊産婦死亡、喫煙、医療費）、UNESCO UIS、UNDP HDR、ILO、UNAIDS、UNODC、UNICEF、World Happiness Report 2024（主にOur World in Data経由）。過去とこれからの世界には、UN World Population Prospects 2024、World Urbanization Prospects 2018、Maddison Project 2020、UCDP/PRIO、Lee-Lee 2016も使っています。一部の交通事故死亡率と児童婚の割合、欠けている値は、地域平均などの方法で推定しました。World Bank、Our World in Data、Maddison、UCDP（CC BY 4.0）とUN（CC BY 3.0 IGO）のデータを加工して使用しています。","Light or dark: follows your device":"画面の明るさ：端末の設定に合わせる","World map with dots showing the countries where people in this simulation are living right now":"このシミュレーションの中の人たちがいま暮らしている国を点で示した世界地図","Where you were actually born":"あなたが実際に生まれた国","Music volume":"音楽の音量","Previous memorials":"前のメモリアル","Next memorials":"次のメモリアル","Time controls":"時間の操作","More":"その他","Let decisions be made for you and just watch":"決断をまかせて、ただ見守る","Calm background music":"静かなBGM","Pause at 5, 15, 30, 50 and 70 to write down a thought":"5・15・30・50・70歳で立ち止まり、思いを書き残す","This life right now":"いまのこの人生","Measures and this year's focus":"指標と今年の重点","Waiting decision":"保留中の決断"};
